<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>China's Development</title>
    <style> /* CSS 代码放在这里 */ </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- 主标题 -->
        <div class="header">
            <h1>China's Development</h1>
            <h2>--- THE race and the care</h2>
        </div>

        <!-- 插入的小图 -->
        <div class="inset-container left-inset">
            <div class="connector-line"></div>
            <img src="unsplash-city" alt="City">
        </div>
        <div class="inset-container right-inset">
            <div class="connector-line"></div>
            <img src="unsplash-farm" alt="Farm">
        </div>

        <!-- 左下角文本 -->
        <div class="quote-text">
            Development brings convenience,<br>
            but not everyone can keep pace.<br>
            Fortunately, China chooses to grow together,<br>
            leaving no one behind.
        </div>

        <!-- START 按钮 -->
        <div class="start-button">START</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>v